  <escalation>
    <trigger>If the live DataGrid skipSet (configResolution.ts:361-371) no longer matches the spec list (primary id + createdon, modifiedon, createdby, modifiedby, ownerid, statecode, statuscode, versionnumber), STOP and escalate per CLAUDE.md section 6 — do NOT invent a new list and do NOT silently adopt the divergent one. FR-04 requires the SAME skip set.</trigger>
    <trigger>If the 030 schema or the metadata projection cannot supply an input the merge needs (e.g. requirement level missing from the projected attribute shape), STOP and escalate rather than widening the schema or reaching for I/O inside the resolver.</trigger>
